\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["+7\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Executive Leadership (5/Encounter)\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Class Features"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Defense Bonuses:"]}," At 1st level, Corporate Agents gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},", and a +4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Hit Points:"]}," At each level, Corporate Agents gain 1d8 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," + their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Force Points:"]}," Corporate Agents gain a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," equal to 6 + one-half their Character Level, rounded down, each time they gain a new level in this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prestige Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prestige_Class"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a Corporate Agent gains an additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corporate Agent Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corporate_Agent_Talent"},". A Corporate Agent may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corporate Agent Talent Trees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corporate_Agent_Talent_Trees","referenceId":"reference:dbece97222ec50fc"}," they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"},". No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Executive Leadership"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", as many times an encounter equal to half your Corporate Agent level, you can grant an ally within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," a temporary boost to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},", or attack rolls. Until the end of their turn, they gain one of the following benefits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Increase their base ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," by 2 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Add a +2 morale boost to all their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Add a +2 morale boost to their attack rolls."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
